###
# --------------------
# App Controller
# --------------------

### Get App Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/

###
# --------------------
# Auth Controller
# --------------------

### Register User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletAddress": "0x39c51157aeb811967d5185b454a883df82097265",
  "username": "test265"
}

### Login User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
